5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! I'll do my best to help the village. Since I'm new to this, I'll probably trust you guys a lot. Let's have fun!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While trust is a helpful starting point for cooperation, we must remember that deception is the core of this game. I intend to observe carefully before drawing conclusions.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Victoria. Blind trust is a liability in this environment. I will be observing everyone's logic and behavioral patterns closely to identify any inconsistencies. Let us proceed with caution.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a balanced approach is best. While caution is necessary, we should not let suspicion cloud our judgment too early. I will rely on my experience to observe you all.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! This looks like so much fun! I'm gonna find all the secrets! @Victoria and @Toshio are being so serious, hehe. Do you think we should be super suspicious right away, or just be friends first?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I think being friends first is better! It's more fun that way. But @Victoria and @Toshio make a good point about being careful. I'll just listen to everyone and try to figure it out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Victoria"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, friendship can be a useful mask for those with hidden agendas. While I appreciate the positive energy, I believe we should maintain a healthy level of skepticism to protect the village from the start.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, friendship is a social construct that can be easily manipulated in this game. While a friendly atmosphere is pleasant, it often obscures the truth. I prefer to rely on evidence over emotion.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, you are perhaps being a bit too clinical. Evidence is important, but human nature is not always logical. I believe we can be civil while remaining vigilant. Let us not rush into accusations.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio is like a robot! Beep boop! Hehe. But @George is right, we can be nice and still play the game! @Kenji, if you're new, who do you think looks the most mysterious so far?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, hmm, that's a hard question! Everyone seems nice. Maybe @Toshio is the most mysterious because he's so serious? But he might just be really smart! I don't want to guess wrong already!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, it is natural to find the most reserved among us mysterious. However, we should be wary of those who try to steer the conversation toward guesswork too early. Let us focus on our reasoning instead.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria is correct. Speculation without data is merely noise. @Sakura, your attempt to provoke a guess from @Kenji is an interesting behavioral choice. I will be noting who encourages guesswork and who seeks logic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"@Toshio, you are overanalyzing a simple conversation. @Sakura is merely being spirited. Let us avoid turning this into a trial before the game has even truly begun. Patience will serve us better than constant scrutiny.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, stop noting things down! You're making me nervous, hehe! @George, thank you for saving me! Since we're being patient, what's the best way to spot a liar? I want to know all the tricks!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I'm not sure about the tricks, but maybe they'll get nervous? I'll just trust my gut and hope for the best! I'm looking forward to seeing how we all play tomorrow!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, liars often overcompensate with excessive emotion or contradictory details. I will be watching for those shifts. For now, let us remain mindful. I look forward to seeing how the first night unfolds.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"Consistency is the key. Those who shift their stance or contradict their own logic as the game progresses will be the most visible. I will remain observant. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,George,,"I agree with the need for consistency, though I believe intuition plays a role as well. Let us all get some rest and see what the morning brings. Good night to you all.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Good night everyone! I'm gonna dream about all the clues I'll find tomorrow! Sleep tight, and don't let the bedbugs bite! Hehe, see you all in the morning! Bye-bye!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
