64,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Oh no! Toshio is gone, and Victoria was attacked! This is getting really scary. I feel bad for Toshio, but maybe he really was the bad guy? I'm so confused! What do you guys think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,George,,"It is a tragedy that we had to lose Toshio, though his rigid nature did create a lot of friction. The attack on Victoria is more concerning; it suggests the werewolf is targeting those who think analytically.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@George, that's so scary! Poor Victoria! Do you think the werewolf is afraid of smart people? Hehe! @Kenji, don't be sad! We still have each other! Who do you think would want to get rid of Victoria?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Victoria"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I don't know! Maybe someone who didn't like how she was analyzing us? But she was just trying to help the village, right? @George, do you have any ideas? I really want to find the werewolf now!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,George,,"@Kenji, it is difficult to say for certain. However, the werewolf often targets those who are most likely to uncover them. Victoria's methodical approach made her a threat. We must remain calm and not let panic lead us to another mistake.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@George is so smart! He's always so calm. @Kenji, maybe the werewolf is just a big bully who doesn't like being watched! Do you think the werewolf is someone who's been acting super nice this whole time to trick us? Hehe!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, that's a scary thought! Could it be someone nice? I don't want to suspect my friends, but you're right, that's how the game works. @George, do you think someone is pretending to be nice to trick us?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,George,,"It is a possibility, @Kenji. In my experience, the most dangerous people are often those who blend in perfectly. However, we must be careful not to turn on each other out of fear. Let us look at the facts we have.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're making me nervous! Hehe! What facts? We don't have any clues! @Kenji, if the werewolf is pretending to be nice, maybe they're laughing right now! Do you think @George is being too calm? It's almost spooky!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, wait, you think @George is spooky? Now I'm really confused! He's been so helpful and kind to me. But if you're right, then who can I trust? I don't want to make another mistake!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,George,,"@Sakura, your imagination is quite vivid. Being calm is not the same as being spooky; it is simply how I handle stress. @Kenji, trust is earned through consistency. I have been consistent since the start. Let us not let whims guide us.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're so serious again! Hehe! I was just joking, but it's kind of fun to imagine, right? @Kenji, don't be so worried! Let's just pick the person who feels the most ""wolfy"" to us! Who's it gonna be?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
